# Package Management (APT, YUM, DNF)
Package Management is the process of installing, updating, upgrading and removing software packages in Linux using package managers like APT, YUM and DNF.

>Package Kya Hota Hai?
Package ek compressed file hoti hai jisme:
Software program
Configuration files
Libraries
Documentation


>Package Management Ke Fayde
Software installation easy hota hai.
Dependencies automatically install ho jati hain.
Software update aur upgrade karna simple hota hai.
System secure aur updated rehta hai.
